#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:5 06083ad423414c4c8399baba97d7e779
msgid ""
"`A Long Range FPV Plane <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/100-km-in-the-"
"x-uav-mini-talon>`_"
msgstr ""
"`A Long Range FPV Plane <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/100-km-in-the-"
"x-uav-mini-talon>`_"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:16 093553a27afc4c81a8420a41580d3100
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:18 c423df39b1b140daaa858224d9c45e9e
msgid ""
"Among hobbyists, the X-UAV MiniTalon has become one of the most popular FPV "
"Plane platforms due to its excellent flying characteristics and high "
"efficiency flight. Durations of greater than 1 hour are easily obtained, "
"with durations exceeding 2X that possible with easily obtained components."
msgstr ""
"在业余爱好者中，X-UAV MiniTalon 因其出色的飞行特性和高效飞行已成为最受欢迎的 FPV 飞机平台之一。轻松可达超过 1 "
"小时的飞行时间，使用易得的部件可超过该时间的 2 倍。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:20 cd4f960823b54a47ad33570c192fbec2
msgid ""
"It is capable a relatively high load capacity, allowing it to carry HD video"
" cameras, on fully stabilized gimbles for long duration flights. And "
"configured as a basic FPV plane it is also very manuerable and sporty."
msgstr ""
"它具有相对较高的载重能力，能够携带高清摄像机，安装在完全稳定的云台上进行长时间飞行。配置为基本 FPV 飞机时，它也非常灵活机动且动感十足。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:22 91598ad478ab4e1982f3c01fb5a1a533
msgid ""
"This guide illustrates some general building tips, as well as a basic "
"ArduPlane configuration for an FPV plane."
msgstr "本指南展示了一些一般组装技巧，以及 FPV 飞机的基本 ArduPlane 配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:24 527ee2e7495e44fc9375b051a2e44eb3
msgid ""
"Many of the photos and descriptions are borrowed from Mark QVale's `website "
"<https://itsqv.com>`_. which shows many other configurations, tips, and 3D "
"printed parts, including many gimbles, for the MiniTalon. An `RCG thread "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?2043439-Talon-MINI-FPV-"
"plane-official-thread>`_ also has extensive information on variations."
msgstr ""
"许多照片和描述借鉴自 Mark QVale 的 `网站 <https://itsqv.com>`_，其中展示了许多其他配置、技巧和 3D 打印零件，包括"
" MiniTalon 的许多云台。`RCG 主题帖 "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?2043439-Talon-MINI-FPV-"
"plane-official-thread>`_ 也有大量关于变体的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:26 b2805aa7dfae47f78ddcfb45747dc05f
msgid ""
"The MiniTalon also leads itself well to `QuadPlane applications "
"<https://mozzie.readthedocs.io/en/latest/Overview.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"MiniTalon 也非常适合 `QuadPlane 应用 "
"<https://mozzie.readthedocs.io/en/latest/Overview.html>`__。"

