#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:51 a92c1ac638a24a0aa0d4485d61d16613
msgid "Airframe: X-UAV MiniTalon RC Plane Kit"
msgstr "机架：X-UAV MiniTalon 遥控飞机套件"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:52 327ea89024234e10b419c76063add9f9
msgid "Motor: Cobra 2221-16 940KV or SunnySky 2216 1450KV"
msgstr "电机：Cobra 2221-16 940KV 或 SunnySky 2216 1450KV"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:53 5f200be5e6954cfdb0af7d33745ae88b
msgid "ESC: 40-60A, no BEC required"
msgstr "ESC：40-60A，无需 BEC"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:54 9a8086eb9e44492fa6462a14e5b6122d
msgid "Prop: APC-E or Aeronaut folding 9X7 for Cobra, 8x6 for Sunnysky motor"
msgstr "螺旋桨：APC-E 或 Aeronaut 折叠桨 9X7（适用于 Cobra），8x6（适用于 Sunnysky 电机）"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:55 90f48cc33186443596f95788ec0a4129
msgid "Servos: 4- 9g to 12g mini servos. EMAX ES08MA, for example."
msgstr "舵机：4 个 9g 至 12g 微型舵机，例如 EMAX ES08MA。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:56 a37811b83cbf4c4ea049e93d3bfb6152
msgid "Autopilot: MatekF405-Wing"
msgstr "飞控：MatekF405-Wing"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:57 b422de1cd8004b8296db91474c683966
msgid ""
"GPS: Any UBLOX MN-8 class GPS with or without compass (Compass is optional)."
" BN-220 is an example."
msgstr "GPS：任何带或不带罗盘的 UBLOX MN-8 级 GPS（罗盘可选）。BN-220 是一个例子。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:58 2b84536e25b04e05a5f847358f8fbed1
msgid ""
"Receiver: Any 6 Channel TX/RX system. For long range, 433 or 900 Mhz systems"
" (Dragonlink, TBS, etc.) are appropriate, short range 2.4GHz (FRSky, Futaba,"
" Spektrum,etc.)."
msgstr ""
"接收机：任何 6 通道遥控/接收系统。长距离可选 433 或 900 MHz 系统（Dragonlink、TBS 等），短距离可选 "
"2.4GHz（FRSky、Futaba、Spektrum 等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:59 1ba20667e17a4e65a6f05b3201eca400
msgid ""
"Telemetry (optional): 3DR or  radio systems, or via the receiver if it has "
"that capability, like Dragonlink (bi-directional) or FRSky (downlink only)."
msgstr "数传（可选）：3DR 或无线电系统，或通过接收机（如果其具有该功能，如双向 Dragonlink 或仅下行链路的 FRSky）。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:60 071a3547a17e40dc89219e6b6272ffa1
msgid ""
"Battery: A 4s 5200mah 10C Lipo will give 45-60 minute duration and fit the "
"general layout for easy CG (Center-of-Gravity) placement."
msgstr "电池：4s 5200mah 10C 锂电池可提供 45-60 分钟续航，并适合一般布局以便于 CG（重心）放置。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:61 a6996a63e6b34428a92d3011d968359e
msgid ""
"FPV Equipment: A miniature video camera and video transmitter are required "
"(if FPV capability is desired, the plane can be flown only line-of-sight, "
"and still fly autonomous missions using a GCS (ground control station) only,"
" if desired. See FPV Equipment section below for suggestions."
msgstr ""
"FPV 设备：需要微型摄像头和视频发射器（如果需要 FPV "
"功能，飞机也可以只进行视距内飞行，并在需要时仅使用地面控制站（地面站）进行自主任务飞行。FPV 设备建议见下方部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:64 7acc2a1cd2224c00828d19508608ec16
msgid "Assembly Tips"
msgstr "组装技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:66 64837e85599f4a11816d2b12be35d46b
msgid ""
"The instructions for building the MiniTalon are straightforward, however, a "
"few tips are shown below that will help."
msgstr "MiniTalon 的组装说明简单明了，但下面展示了一些有用的技巧。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:69 cd8dadf891c24216b92ab3c1331d6162
msgid "Fuse Prep & Glue"
msgstr "机身准备与粘合"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:71 b918f901c96a4faea32c6edee4973a89
msgid ""
"For gluing EPO foam, use Beacon Foam-Tac or E6000 which works very well and "
"it sets fairly quickly. To prepare the pieces, always wash all surfaces of "
"all parts in hot water with a small amount of dish soap to get rid of any "
"mold release agents. Next, do a wipe down with denatured alcohol and finally"
" a light sand on the glue surfaces with #100 grit sandpaper."
msgstr ""
"粘合 EPO 泡沫时，使用 Beacon Foam-Tac 或 "
"E6000，效果非常好且固化较快。准备零件时，始终用热水和少量洗洁精清洗所有零件的所有表面，去除任何模具脱模剂。然后用变性酒精擦拭，最后用 100# "
"砂纸轻轻打磨粘合面。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:73 2e4ae420015b41ce904c092e03dd2b82
msgid ""
"Before gluing the fuselage halves, set up the motor mount plate with APC "
"prop bushings and 3mm blind nuts to get the motor off the wood for better "
"cooling."
msgstr "粘合机身两半前，先安装带有 APC 桨毂衬套和 3mm 盲孔螺母的电机安装板，使电机离木材有一定距离以便更好散热。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:84 2fda266c475041b9a1a3f988a1f0bc84
msgid ""
"After gluing in the motor mount, glue in the center structure. Optionally, "
"add some cable guides to each side and some velcro lock to hold the "
"Receiver. The center structure does not come with a floor in the kit to "
"allow mounting the autopilot. Either add a ply plate to the bottom, or 3D "
"print one of Mark Qvale's mounting plates from his `website "
"<https://itsqv.com>`_."
msgstr ""
"粘合电机安装板后，粘合中央结构。可选地，在每侧添加一些线缆导向件，并用魔术贴固定接收机。中央结构套件中没有底板以便安装飞控。可以在底部添加胶合板，或从 "
"Mark Qvale 的 `网站 <https://itsqv.com>`_ 上 3D 打印一个安装板。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:93 4b10ba43870848a6b13fd8be867a0c9a
msgid "Optional Front Skid"
msgstr "可选前滑橇"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:95 2fda0fbb8e0640eda04abae0c51d3523
msgid ""
"The kit comes with a front wheel. This breaks quickly, so it's suggested "
"that it not be used. Either tape the area with re-enforced packing tape or "
"3D print or fabricate a ply skid as shown below."
msgstr "套件附带前轮，但容易损坏，建议不要使用。可以用加强包装胶带覆盖该区域，或 3D 打印或制作如下所示的胶合板滑橇。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:100 df11d34aaab6440894b85c90b1961faf
msgid ""
"Coating the tail skid with re-enforced tape will also increase its life."
msgstr "用加强胶带覆盖尾部滑橇也会延长其使用寿命。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:103 06ae0f1be9904a17925f5644ad5e2a41
msgid "Vtail Servo Linkage"
msgstr "V 形尾翼舵机连杆"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:105 e4aa36910ca94593b831c6da691dfa5a
msgid ""
"The provides straight pushrods to the Vtail surfaces. However, there is high"
" miss-alignment caused by the stock geometry which puts the linkage at an "
"angle to the control surface. The linkage, as provided will work reliably, "
"however, to reduce strain and any possibility of wear, you can use a ball-"
"link as shown below."
msgstr ""
"套件提供直推杆连接 V "
"形尾翼舵面。但由于原始几何结构使连杆与控制舵面成角度，存在较大的不对齐。提供的连杆可靠工作，但为减少应力和磨损的可能性，可以使用如下所示的球形连杆。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:111 74b25dc1b0334efda057846085560ad6
msgid "Power Train"
msgstr "动力系统"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:113 e00930f2e9ec41f7b18887a6bc1a0460
msgid ""
"It's important to keep the leads from the autopilot's ESC power terminals "
"short (<4-5inchs)to the ESC. If long leads are unavoidable, you will need to"
" add low-ESR capacitors to the ESC input to prevent possible damage. Some "
"ESCs already have these capacitors."
msgstr ""
"从飞控的 ESC 电源端子到 ESC 的引线应保持短（< 4-5 英寸）。如果引线不可避免地较长，需要在 ESC 输入端添加低 ESR "
"电容以防止可能的损坏。部分 ESC 已内置这些电容。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:115 1b1764db376e40a8bc043d44df54d25e
msgid "Long leads from the ESC to the motor are acceptable."
msgstr "从 ESC 到电机的引线较长是可以接受的。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:117 c86040bc63434cc98d9b95077cfd903e
msgid ""
"Increased efficiency will be obtained if the ESC is programmed to brake hard"
" when gliding. A folding propeller also helps."
msgstr "如果 ESC 编程为滑翔时强力制动，效率会提高。使用折叠螺旋桨也有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:120 d4980cda9a8a45d39a9b36debb7a541d
msgid "Folding Prop Stopper"
msgstr "折叠桨限位器"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:122 ac8ad3c4d64c423d807b81438a59b69b
msgid ""
"If an Aeronaut or other folding prop is used to improve efficiency, it will "
"require a prop stopper. A 3d printed design is available on Mark Qvale's "
"`website <https://itsqv.com>`_."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Aeronaut 或其他折叠桨以提高效率，需要桨限位器。Mark Qvale 的 `网站 <https://itsqv.com>`_ 上有 "
"3D 打印设计。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:128 b0a62cc275e2421b879fb3d96c873009
msgid "Component placement"
msgstr "部件布置"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:130 10c8f5d7b07c49b7895ae5e64ce6d0fd
msgid "The images below illustrate the typical component placement."
msgstr "下图展示了典型的部件布置。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:141 844b9486ebfd4123b6b500027d84b101
msgid ""
"As shown, the GPS and Telemetry connections are compatible with the serial "
"port defaults loaded when the firmware for the Matek autopilot is "
"programmed."
msgstr "如图所示，GPS 和数传连接与为 Matek 飞控编程固件时加载的串口默认设置兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:143 6ff2f23058b746789eca415fcf042184
msgid ""
"The SERVOx_FUNCTIONS will have to be set such that the following is "
"assigned:"
msgstr "需要设置 SERVOx_FUNCTIONS，使以下分配生效："

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:146 4cdaf0d3b7af442eb0efa2a192deeb06
msgid ":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION<SERVO1_FUNCTION>`   |  Throttle"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION<SERVO1_FUNCTION>`   |  油门"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:148 765e0c2ff8b94fb0a40e970e06d21016
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO3_FUNCTION<SERVO3_FUNCTION>`   |  Both Ailerons via Y-servo cable"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO3_FUNCTION<SERVO3_FUNCTION>`   |  通过 Y 形舵机线连接的两个副翼"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:150 9e9258e312c04ba0846251b5eb1c256d
msgid ":ref:`SERVO4_FUNCTION<SERVO4_FUNCTION>`   |  VTail Left"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO4_FUNCTION<SERVO4_FUNCTION>`   |  VTail 左"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:152 64abd821e63246858ffb05173637762b
msgid ":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>`   |  VTail Right"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>`   |  VTail 右"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:155 12f5e6aab8e146b2ad4f357cb4895fdc
msgid ""
"If the aileron servos are  attached to separate PWM outputs the "
":ref:`flaperons<flaperons-on-plane>` function can be implemented. However, "
"since the MiniTalon does not use full length ailerons, the flap effect will "
"be limited and can even be detrimental, causing increased sensitivity to "
"\"tip stalls\"."
msgstr ""
"如果副翼舵机连接到独立的 PWM 输出，可以实现 :ref:`flaperons<flaperons-on-plane>` 功能。但由于 "
"MiniTalon 不使用全长副翼，襟翼效果有限，甚至可能有害，导致对「翼尖失速」的敏感性增加。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:157 8e00fff0398840b7b960d9fc57326d27
msgid ""
"If an LRS (Long Range RC System) is utilized, mounting the antenna is "
"critical to achieving maximum distance. Most LRS systems use a dipole. Shown"
" below is a 3d printed mount that assures that both elements are vertical. "
"Any method that assures that the dipole is mounted vertically will be "
"satisfactory."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 LRS（长距离遥控系统），天线安装对于实现最大距离至关重要。大多数 LRS 系统使用偶极天线。下方展示了确保两个天线单元垂直的 3D "
"打印支架。任何能确保偶极天线垂直安装的方法都可以。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:166 03dd6fbd0a45427ca1d38b311c7738d0
msgid "Configuration/Parameter Setup"
msgstr "配置/参数设置"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:168 6e82d2dfb96c441f8423c507068fcf75
msgid "See :ref:`FPV Plane <basic-setup>` for information on software setup."
msgstr "参见 :ref:`FPV Plane <basic-setup>` 了解软件设置信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:171 91abdb125c6748c8b4e153c22e47e1c9
msgid "FPV Equipment"
msgstr "FPV 设备"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:173 e66fee7af5004ab98c4730ad2a82e56c
msgid ""
"Choices for FPV cameras and transmitters are numerous and increase daily. Be"
" sure that both camera and video transmitter can operate at 9V, since the "
"MatekF405-Wing autopilot provides this supply for video. Optionally, the "
"video supply can be changed from 9V to 12V via a solder jumper on the back "
"of the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"FPV 摄像头和发射器的选择非常多且每天都在增加。确保摄像头和视频发射器都能在 9V 下工作，因为 MatekF405-Wing "
"飞控为视频提供此供电。或者，可以通过飞控背面的焊接跳线将视频供电从 9V 改为 12V。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:175 4d97d7321f224c33beb2b8cb32aa9f4b
msgid ""
"For long range operation, the video transmitter should operate on 1.2Ghz or "
"1.3Ghz . For distances of 2Km or less, 5.8GHz transmission is usually used."
msgstr "对于远距离操作，视频发射器应工作在 1.2GHz 或 1.3GHz。对于 2km 以下的距离，通常使用 5.8GHz 传输。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:177 517a8923c2b3469dbeb764a4f3e4aec9
msgid ""
"No external OSD (On Screen Display) is required since the MatekF405-Wing has"
" it integrated."
msgstr "无需外部 OSD（屏幕显示），因为 MatekF405-Wing 已集成。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:179 0546e061ca7f4d3298b47718665e9256
msgid "See the :ref:`FPV information page <common-fpv-first-person-view>`."
msgstr "参见 :ref:`FPV information page <common-fpv-first-person-view>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:182 820b32fb96b346c6982e6af4f93f2e37
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:185 51349ea1f6fe4441b17067223377047c
msgid "Airspeed Sensor"
msgstr "空速传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:187 4d407b257cf24c46b6613fe5ac6259f6
msgid ""
"With the addition of a digital airspeed sensor, precision airspeed control "
"can be obtained during cruise portions of flight, and can be attached to the"
" MatekF405-Wing autopilot's CL1/DA1 or CL2/DA2 pins. However, this is "
"optional and ArduPlane flies extremely well without this addition. See the "
":ref:`Airspeed sensor <airspeed>` section for more information."
msgstr ""
"通过添加数字空速传感器，可以在巡航阶段获得精确的空速控制，并可连接到 MatekF405-Wing 飞控的 CL1/DA1 或 CL2/DA2 "
"引脚。但这是可选的，没有此传感器 ArduPlane 也飞行得非常好。更多信息请参见 :ref:`Airspeed sensor <airspeed>`"
" 部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:196 bf2f8c98807c41eabefd5b68fb67fb34
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:198 4a6bd9ae3d094349b2d954f227112bf3
msgid ""
"Similarly, a compass can be added by attaching to the autopilot's CL1/DA1 or"
" CL2/DA2 pins. This is also optional and provides marginally better "
"navigation tracking in CRUISE and AUTO modes."
msgstr ""
"同样，可以通过连接到飞控的 CL1/DA1 或 CL2/DA2 引脚来添加罗盘。这也是可选的，在 CRUISE 和 AUTO "
"模式下提供稍微更好的导航跟踪。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:202 d687edccf2254e08b378d6037b19ab65
msgid "Gimbles"
msgstr "云台"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:204 bf074237bb5f4d2f891a9e92bbbd5764
msgid ""
"Many options exist for mounting either an HD recording camera and/or the "
"flight video camera to a pan/tilt controllable mount. In addition, these "
"gimble mounts can even be stabilized in one or more axis. to provide cinema-"
"like stability. Mark Qvale's `website <https://itsqv.com>`_ has many "
"examples and versions."
msgstr ""
"安装高清录像摄像头和/或飞行视频摄像头到可平移/倾斜控制支架的选项很多。此外，这些云台支架甚至可以在一个或多个轴上稳定，以提供电影级稳定效果。Mark "
"Qvale 的 `网站 <https://itsqv.com>`_ 有许多示例和版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:206 c3d26b503bbf45318bc4dda50eb89521
msgid ""
"It is usually not a good idea to have the flight camera mounted on a "
"stabilized mount since the operator will lose the feedback of the plane's "
"attitude while flying."
msgstr "通常不建议将飞行摄像头安装在稳定支架上，因为这样操作员在飞行时会失去飞机姿态的反馈。"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:219 6434184f72b84810b79b6b907b06678a
msgid "3D Printed Accessories"
msgstr "3D 打印配件"

#: ../../source/docs/miniTalon-build.rst:221 cadf86d1c10f449a8290ab474dbf4b3e
msgid ""
"Many 3D printable accessories/parts are available on Mark Qvale's `website "
"<https://itsqv.com>`_"
msgstr "许多 3D 可打印配件/零件可在 Mark Qvale 的 `网站 <https://itsqv.com>`_ 上找到"

